<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="joye" version="22.1.0" type="device">
  <diagram id="client-report-ai-summary" name="Client Report AI Summary">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1000" pageHeight="1420" math="0" shadow="0" background="#F8FAFC">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0"/>
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
        <mxCell id="title" value="Client Report AI Summary" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=26;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="32" y="16" width="700" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle" value="Finished month only. The dashboard reads saved text. The cron only wakes admin-service." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="32" y="52" width="936" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cron" value="joye-crons&#xa;&#xa;Runs on the 2nd of each month.&#xa;Sends POST /internal/client-report-summaries/tick with an empty body.&#xa;Does not load tenants, scores, or prompts. A later tick polls a batch that is still running." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#64748B;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=12;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="32" y="100" width="936" height="168" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="admin" value="admin-service&#xa;&#xa;Tick handler. All month data and model calls stay here." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;fontColor=#1D4ED8;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=12;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="32" y="324" width="936" height="430" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sources" value="Source month data&#xa;&#xa;Read only. Existing collections.&#xa;Wellbeing and the 5 prior months.&#xa;Categories, features, and chat.&#xa;Org-analytics month record." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;fontColor=#B45309;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=12;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="32" y="820" width="301" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="summary" value="Client_Report_Ai_Summary&#xa;&#xa;One tenant row per finished month.&#xa;One platform row, tId null.&#xa;snapshot, inputHash, status.&#xa;highlights and recommendations." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;fontColor=#B45309;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=12;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="349" y="820" width="301" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="batch" value="Client_Report_Ai_Batch&#xa;&#xa;One row per platform, month, phase.&#xa;Stores anthropicBatchId.&#xa;The next tick polls this id.&#xa;phase: tenant, then platform." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;fontColor=#B45309;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=12;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="666" y="820" width="301" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="anthropic" value="Anthropic Message Batches&#xa;&#xa;Steps 5 and 7 submit a batch.&#xa;Step 6 polls that batch.&#xa;Tenant items first.&#xa;One platform item after results are saved." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#F5F3FF;strokeColor=#6D28D9;fontColor=#6D28D9;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=12;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="666" y="1072" width="301" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="dashboard" value="joye-admin  /client-report&#xa;&#xa;Reads saved Highlights and Recommendations.&#xa;One tenant shows that tenant summary.&#xa;All tenants show the platform summary.&#xa;Does not call the model." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#047857;fontColor=#047857;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=12;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="349" y="1072" width="301" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step1" value="1    Resolve the finished month. On 2 November the month is October." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#93C5FD;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;strokeWidth=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="372" width="904" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step2" value="2    Load active organizations for each platform." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#93C5FD;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;strokeWidth=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="426" width="904" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step3" value="3    Build the metric snapshot from the existing analytics services." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#93C5FD;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;strokeWidth=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="480" width="904" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step4" value="4    Hash snapshot + prompt version + model. The same hash stops." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#93C5FD;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;strokeWidth=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="534" width="904" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step5" value="5    Submit one Anthropic batch for tenants whose hash changed." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#93C5FD;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;strokeWidth=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="588" width="904" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step6" value="6    On a later tick, poll the batch and save highlights and recommendations." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#93C5FD;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;strokeWidth=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="642" width="904" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="step7" value="7    After every tenant is complete, submit one platform batch." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#93C5FD;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;strokeWidth=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="48" y="696" width="904" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note" value="October is generated on or after 2 November, after that month&#x27;s org-analytics record is complete. There is no mid-month summary. A manual Regenerate uses this same tick with a chosen platform, year, and month." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontColor=#475569;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="32" y="1302" width="936" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e_tick" value="POST tick" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#334155;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;rounded=0;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="500" y="268" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="500" y="324" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_rw" value="read and write" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#334155;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;rounded=0;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="500" y="754" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="500" y="810" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_read" value="read saved text" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#334155;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;rounded=0;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="499.5" y="1000" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="499.5" y="1072" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_batch_api" value="submit and poll" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#334155;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;html=1;rounded=0;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="816.5" y="1000" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="816.5" y="1072" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
